{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんこんばんわ〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/photos/icon/scissors.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めちゃくちゃ風邪ひいて\n鼻がｽﾞﾙｽﾞﾙ〜です(´:ω;`)う"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"辛いよ〜〜う。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ﾏｽｸとﾃｨｯｼｭはあたしの\n相方になりました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/photos/icon/despair.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"う。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんも風邪にならない\nように注意してください!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"手洗い、うがいは基本"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/photos/icon/sun.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(手洗いうがい毎日して\nたのにそんなあたし"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/photos/icon/cherry.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"は\n風邪になりましたww)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さてさて皆さんから\nたくさんの質問が\n来ているので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どどど〜んとお答え\nしちゃいましょう(´ω｀)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぶろぐ毎日かけなくて\nごめんなさい(;o;)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/photos/icon/typhoon.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも書いてる途中で\n寝ちゃうんです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/photos/icon/cloud.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"う。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、その前に前回の記事の\n似顔絵なんですが正解は\n左→ななみん･左→まいまい\nでしたっ☆"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/photos/icon/cloud.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"意外にも分かった方がたくさん\nいてびっくり(´ﾟωﾟ`)わ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うんうん、乃木坂らぶ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/photos/icon/heart.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"な\n方がたくさんいて嬉しい\nです〜(´ﾟωﾟ`)わ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それではどど〜ん!\nおまちかね、Q&Aｺｰﾅｰ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どどどど〜〜〜ん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q.邦楽･洋楽で好きな\nｱｰﾃｨｽﾄさんは?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A.洋楽は全然聞かないん\nですが加藤ﾐﾘﾔさん\n西野ｶﾅさんなど雰囲気が\nふんわり"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/photos/icon/bar.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"していて可愛い\nと思います(´ω｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q.趣味とか好きなことある?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A.最近はまってることは\nﾊﾞﾙｰﾝｱｰﾄで色んなものを\n作ることです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/photos/icon/cute.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今はｳｻｷﾞに\nﾁｬﾚﾝｼﾞちゅう(´ﾟωﾟ`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q.しりーずはお尻とかけてるの?\nA.あ、これびっくりよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/photos/icon/bell.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あたしでもきずかなかったのに\n発見した方が多いみたいで"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/photos/icon/cute.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"w"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なかなか、ゆったんﾌﾞﾛｸﾞ\n読み込んでますね\nそこのあなた(´･ω･`)ｷﾗﾘ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q.ｵｽｽﾒｺｺｱはどこ?\nﾐﾙｸｺｺｱはあり?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A.んーどこのｺｺｱも美味しい\nですが家にあるのは必ず\n『Meiji』"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もとからmilkが\nもとから入ってるけど\nあたしはまたmilkいれて\nもっと濃厚にしちゃいますよ☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q.ﾁｬﾚﾝｼﾞ系ｲﾍﾞﾝﾄの出演依頼が\n来ましたどっちに挑戦しますか?\n①本物が出るお化け屋敷(九州)\n②高さ233mからのﾊﾞﾝｼﾞｰ(香港)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A.どっちも嫌や〜(´:ω;`)\nだけどやるならﾊﾞﾝｼﾞｰかな"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/photos/icon/despair.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本物が出るとかﾀﾞﾒでしょ。\nお化け屋敷は大の苦手"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/photos/icon/mist.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"目つぶって友達に捕まるもん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q.好きなｱｲﾄﾞﾙ 漫画 ｱﾆﾒは?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A.ﾗｲﾊﾞﾙだけどAKB48さんが\nｷﾗｷﾗ輝いててｽｷです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/photos/icon/cherryblossom.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"漫画は〜ｽｲｯﾁｶﾞｰﾙかな。\n少女漫画なんだけど\n知ってますか?あとﾀｲﾄﾙ\n忘れちゃったけど 女の子も\n男の子も両方 椿っていう\n名前のやつ。めちゃくちゃ\nきゅんきゅん(´･ω･`)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/photos/icon/heart.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"する"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ｱﾆﾒはーんー最近見ないな〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/photos/icon/cloud.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んー分かりません。\nごめんなさい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/photos/icon/sad.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q.どんなｲﾍﾞﾝﾄやりたい?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A.乃木坂を5ｸﾞﾙｰﾌﾟぐらい\nに分けてﾌｧﾝの方々も\n抽選で振り分けて大縄\nやりたいです(;o;)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/photos/icon/heart02.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"勝ったｸﾞﾙｰﾌﾟから\n一緒にご飯食べれるみたいな?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うんうん、楽しそう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/photos/icon/bud.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ﾜｲ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q.好きな動物･飼いたい動物は?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A.好きな動物はやっぱり\nﾜﾝちゃんかな〜あと\n絵に書いたようなｸﾏ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/11/24/2011112421210000.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あたしのﾓｶくん。\n毎日元気いっぱい〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/photos/icon/kissmark.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"飼いたい動物か〜ん〜\n猫とかも一時期\n飼いたいって思ってたかな"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/photos/icon/clover.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よ〜し、それではそろ\nそろこの辺で♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ばいばい☆また見てね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"鼻水とまらないよ〜う(´:ω;`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たんたんたん ゆったん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"_"}],"source":"archive"}